{
  "about": "Pinned inputs (docs/DESIGN.md#engine-and-data), each from an immutable release of this repository: our engine, the two data packages, and the CTAN files the tests and templates use (the test inputs' release: TeX Live's archives, unchanged, and CTAN's revtex.tds.zip). Files are fetched by scripts/engine-assets.mjs into ../engine_assets/<folder>/ (outside the repository) and checked by size and SHA-256; a file with \"from\" is unpacked from one of its source's \"archives\", each checked by size and SHA-512 first. Never commit the files themselves.",
