      "folder": "livemd2tex-engine-6a30018-4",
      "release": "https://github.com/haberwooki/liveMd2Tex/releases/tag/engine-6a30018-4",
      "tag": "engine-6a30018-4",
      "published": "2026-11-02",
      "commit": "2594ca2e05764e77580ce19c7403d75fac1907ae",
      "licence": "liveMd2Tex's TeX engine (pdfTeX, XeTeX, xdvipdfmx and bibtex8 with kpathsea, built from TeX Live's source by engine/build/ with Emscripten): GPL-3.0 as a whole, each part under its own terms (engine/engine-notices.json; the release's NOTICE); our own code GPL-3.0-or-later; TeX Live data under each package licence (docs/DESIGN.md#store-and-packaging).",
      "note": "Our engine release, built by .github/workflows/engine.yml at the commit above; engine-build.json records the build, and a WSL build of the same commit gave the same engine.wasm and engine.js (scripts/engine-compare.mjs). published is the date the owner published the release. It is an immutable release, so its files cannot change: scripts/engine-assets.mjs downloads them anonymously from the addresses below and checks each one's size and SHA-256.",
